  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> flows in the circuit as shown in figure. The value of potential difference between the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> will be</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0133_58884d671a5c.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 173px;\" /></p>"
  },
